          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ni mwele muyaŵelaga yindu. Ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵajinjilaga mcipinda candanda cila masiku gosope kujakamula masengo gawo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.2+NUM.18.3+NUM.18.4+NUM.18.5+NUM.18.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 18:2-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nambo mcipinda caŵili cila mwajinjilaga jwamkulungwa jwa ŵakutaga mbopesi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jika, nipo kamope pa caka. Ŵajinjilaga ali ajigele miasi kuja kujitaga mbopesi kwa Mlungu ligongo lya msyene soni ligongo lya ulemwa wa ŵandu ŵiŵatesile mwangamanyilila kuti akulemwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.16.2+LEV.16.3+LEV.16.4+LEV.16.5+LEV.16.6+LEV.16.7+LEV.16.8+LEV.16.9+LEV.16.10+LEV.16.11+LEV.16.12+LEV.16.13+LEV.16.14+LEV.16.15+LEV.16.16+LEV.16.17+LEV.16.18+LEV.16.19+LEV.16.20+LEV.16.21+LEV.16.22+LEV.16.23+LEV.16.24+LEV.16.25+LEV.16.26+LEV.16.27+LEV.16.28+LEV.16.29+LEV.16.30+LEV.16.31+LEV.16.32+LEV.16.33+LEV.16.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lef 16:2-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msimu Ŵaswela akwiganya kuti litala lyakwinjilila ku Cipinda Ceswela Mnope nganiliwuguce ligongo cipinda candanda cila caciŵelape. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeleyi yili yakuwanicisya cabe, nipo yikulosya ndaŵi ajino. Pakuyicisya kulongosola kweleku mituka ni mbopesi sisikusapelecedwa kwa Mlungu ngaŵamkomboleka kose kuwugalawusya mtima wa jwakulambilajo kuti aŵe jwambone mtima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yikusagamba kusala ya yakulya, yakumwa, ni misyungu jakulekanganalekangana jakojela. Yosopeyo yili ya malamusi gakusala yakuwoneka ni meso basi, gaŵicidwe kuti gagambe kutama mpaka ndaŵi jitacikolosya Mlungu yosope.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
